---
layout: base.njk
title: "Services & Price Menu — Polished Nail Bar DTLA"
description: "Full service menu and clear pricing: manicures, luxury pedicures, GelX, hard gel, BIAB, acrylic, dip, custom nail art and waxing in Downtown LA."
permalink: /services/
---
<section class="masthead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="u10 mute">Services · {{ site.name }}</span>
    <h1 class="mega">The full menu</h1>
    <p class="lead">GelX, Russian gel, BIAB, acrylic, dip, custom nail art and luxury pedicures — every technique, done to one standard, with clear pricing before we start.</p>
    <div class="tags">
      {%- for c in services.categories -%}<span class="u10">{{ c.heading }}</span>{%- endfor -%}
    </div>
    <div class="btns">
      <a class="btn" href="{{ site.booking_services_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a service</a>
      <a class="btn btn-o" href="/faq/">Not sure what to book?</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="band" aria-hidden="true"><div class="t">
  {%- for pass in [1,2] -%}
  <span>{{ site.service_band_words }} — <em>{{ site.service_band_accent }}</em> — {{ site.service_band_tail }} — </span>
  {%- endfor -%}
</div></div>

{% for c in services.categories %}
<section class="sec wrap">
  <div class="sh rv">
    <div class="top"><span class="u10 mute">{{ c.label }}</span></div>
    <h2 class="big">{{ c.heading }}</h2>
    {% if c.intro %}<p class="say">{{ c.intro }}</p>{% endif %}
  </div>
  {%- set twoPrice = false -%}
  {%- for i in c.items %}{% if "|" in i.price %}{% set twoPrice = true %}{% endif %}{% endfor -%}
  {% if twoPrice %}<div class="pricekey rv"><span>Base | Gel</span></div>{% endif %}
  <div class="menu tight rv">
    {%- for i in c.items %}
    <div class="mrow">
      <span class="n">{% if i.tag %}<span class="tag">{{ i.tag }}</span>{% endif %}{{ i.name }}</span>
      <span class="p">{{ i.price }}</span>
      {%- if i.note %}<span class="ds">{{ i.note }}</span>{% endif -%}
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endfor %}

<section class="sec wrap" style="padding-top:0">
  <p class="fine">Prices vary with nail length, shape, condition, design complexity and product usage. Ask for a quote before your service begins — full terms are on the <a href="/policies/">policies page</a>.</p>
</section>
